<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>App Under Maintenance</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #f5f7fb;
            color: #1e293b;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .maintenance-container {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(146, 163, 225, 0.15);
            max-width: 450px;
            width: 100%;
            border: 1px solid rgba(146, 163, 225, 0.2);
            animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease-in-out;
        }

        .gif-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 250px;
            margin: 0 auto 25px auto;
        }

        .gif-wrapper img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1e293b;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #64748b;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #f0f3ff;
            color: #6d7fbf;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            border: 1px solid rgba(146, 163, 225, 0.3);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="maintenance-container">
        <div class="gif-wrapper">
            <img src="https://i.postimg.cc/Y281QC4f/04489f0a-1168-11ee-acde-3f59cc25c37d.gif" alt="App Under Maintenance">
        </div>
        
        <h1>We'll Be Back Soon!</h1>
        <p>We are upgrading system modules to give you a smoother experience. Hold tight!</p>
        
        <div class="status-badge">🔧 System Upgrade In Progress</div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
